      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Pre-revenue funnel is live.** Revenue panels (active pro subscriptions, MRR) populate once Polar (#35) is wired — they read `ecobuilding_pro_subscriptions` / `ecobuilding_mrr_eur`, not yet emitted. Nothing here is faked."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Enterprise leads (total)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(ecobuilding_leads_total{kind=\"enterprise\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
